263
00:26:01,993 --> 00:26:07,056
Mr. Bell , if those gates are left open , it may be the end of humanity .

264
00:26:07,131 --> 00:26:09,964
We 've got to try to get them shut again .

265
00:26:10,034 --> 00:26:12,867
At midnight on Monday , we go into All Saints ' Day .

266
00:26:12,937 --> 00:26:15,405
The Night of the Dead begins then .

267
00:26:15,473 --> 00:26:18,374
And if the portals of hell don 't get shut before ,

268
00:26:18,443 --> 00:26:21,378
no dead body will ever be able to rest in peace again .

269
00:26:21,446 --> 00:26:24,108
And so the dead will rise up and take over the Earth and - -

270
00:26:24,182 --> 00:26:26,173
You must . You 've got to get to Dunwich .

271
00:26:26,250 --> 00:26:29,344
