276
00:27:12,330 --> 00:27:14,264
Bob ?

277
00:27:16,834 --> 00:27:18,768
Bob ?

278
00:27:20,538 --> 00:27:22,472
Oh !

279
00:27:24,609 --> 00:27:28,545
