336
00:33:11,489 --> 00:33:14,788
You know , I get my inner visions too , you know .

337
00:33:14,859 --> 00:33:18,556
Just let me meditate over a bottle of scotch and , uh - -

338
00:33:18,629 --> 00:33:21,097
And ?

339
