345
00:34:01,739 --> 00:34:05,106
What was the cause of her death then ? Some kind of cardiac arrest .

346
00:34:05,176 --> 00:34:09,408
Only , that expression on her face looks like pure fear , like something scared her to death .

347
00:34:09,480 --> 00:34:11,414
Scared her to - - Excuse me , Mr. Robbins .

348
00:34:11,482 --> 00:34:13,473
