349
00:34:13,551 --> 00:34:15,485
No . No ?

350
00:34:15,553 --> 00:34:17,544
No , no . She was - - [ Gerry ] Mr. Robbins .

351
00:34:17,621 --> 00:34:20,818
Oh , God . God ! My little girl ! Well , what 's our procedure ?

352
00:34:20,891 --> 00:34:24,486
Sit tight . Everything depends on the autopsy . I 'll sit tight .

353
00:34:24,562 --> 00:34:26,553
