357
00:34:36,774 --> 00:34:40,608
It was - - It was Bob . That pervert . You can bet on it .

358
00:34:40,678 --> 00:34:45,081
They should 've put him away for life after what he tried to do with poor little Ann Ross .

359
00:34:45,149 --> 00:34:48,448
Listen , I 'll call out all cars after that boy .

360
00:34:48,519 --> 00:34:52,285
And I wouldn 't be surprised if he could tell us what happened to Rosie Kelvin ...

361
00:34:52,356 --> 00:34:55,848
