379
00:36:11,835 --> 00:36:13,769
[ Woman ] ... our daily bread ,

380
00:36:13,837 --> 00:36:18,240
and forgive us our trespasses as we forgive those who trespass against us .

381
00:36:18,309 --> 00:36:21,710
And lead us not into temptation , but deliver us from evil .

382
00:36:21,779 --> 00:36:25,271
For thine is the kingdom and the power and the glory .

383
00:36:25,349 --> 00:36:27,874
Amen .

384
00:36:27,952 --> 00:36:32,514
The Lord is my shepherd , I shall not want . This way , please .

385
00:36:32,590 --> 00:36:35,081
He maketh me lie down in green pastures .

386
00:36:35,159 --> 00:36:39,493
Yea though I walk through the valley of the shadow of death ... Where is she ?

387
00:36:39,563 --> 00:36:43,226
Where is my Emily ? They 're still preparing her , Mrs. Robbins .

388
00:36:43,300 --> 00:36:46,565
