392
00:37:53,937 --> 00:37:57,134
Frightened to death ? That 's what he said - - fear .

393
00:37:57,207 --> 00:37:59,141
Of what ?

394
00:37:59,209 --> 00:38:02,269
Damned if I know , Doc . It 's the strangest thing I ever heard of .

395
00:38:04,081 --> 00:38:06,015
Fear .

396
00:38:06,083 --> 00:38:09,644
