397
00:38:09,720 --> 00:38:12,211
They went to the movies last night , and nobody 's seen them since .

398
00:38:12,289 --> 00:38:16,282
That makes five people who 've disappeared in the last 48 hours .

399
00:38:16,360 --> 00:38:20,592
I think it 's Bob . I don 't believe in this superstitious nonsense .

400
00:38:20,664 --> 00:38:23,462
Yeah . Maybe you 're right .

401
00:38:23,534 --> 00:38:28,369
Sure . Remember two years ago when Bob took my little Ann into the woods ?

402
00:38:28,439 --> 00:38:30,999
It was a miracle we found them in time .

403
00:38:31,075 --> 00:38:33,134
Yeah , well , I say it 's him .

404
00:38:33,210 --> 00:38:35,701
