414
00:39:03,574 --> 00:39:05,701
John-John , come on . Let 's go outside .

415
00:39:05,776 --> 00:39:08,438
We 'll take a walk . You have to be strong now .

416
00:39:08,512 --> 00:39:11,037
You have to find the courage to face life , John-John .

417
00:39:11,115 --> 00:39:14,676
You have to be a man now . You know what I mean ? Hmm ?

418
