I 'm hungry . Good .

424
00:40:23,654 --> 00:40:26,782
There 's a lollipop in the glove box .

425
00:40:28,992 --> 00:40:31,119
Look , I 'm not joking . I 'm starved .

426
00:40:31,195 --> 00:40:34,187
Look , you 're the one that got me out here in the armpit of the world ,

427
00:40:34,264 --> 00:40:37,825
