436
00:41:07,965 --> 00:41:10,695
Oh , please , not now . Do you mind ?

437
00:41:10,767 --> 00:41:15,704
Come on . Let 's go check out the , uh , local cuisine , huh ?

438
00:42:10,861 --> 00:42:12,795
[ Sighs ]

