Emily 's back . I saw her looking in the window .

460
00:45:22,185 --> 00:45:24,449
She wanted to catch me . [ Sobbing ]

461
00:45:24,521 --> 00:45:28,355
Emily went away forever , John-John . She 's in heaven .

462
00:45:28,425 --> 00:45:32,987
I saw her , I swear . I saw her . I really did .

463
00:45:33,063 --> 00:45:38,660
- We 'd better call the doctor . - I 'm all right . I don 't need a doctor .

464
00:45:38,735 --> 00:45:40,930
I don 't want a doctor ! I saw her !

465
00:45:41,004 --> 00:45:43,768
You 've had a big day . You 're upset .

466
00:45:43,840 --> 00:45:46,365
