475
00:47:13,763 --> 00:47:15,287
Hello ?

476
00:47:15,365 --> 00:47:19,563
It 's me - - Sandra . You have to come right away .

477
00:47:19,636 --> 00:47:23,163
No , there 's no time to explain . You wouldn 't believe me anyway .

478
00:47:23,240 --> 00:47:26,607
Just come , please . I 'm having a nervous breakdown .

479
00:47:26,676 --> 00:47:30,737
Yes , okay , Sandra . Just calm down and control yourself . What is it ?

480
00:47:30,814 --> 00:47:32,611
