489
00:48:50,660 --> 00:48:53,254
Gerry , is that you ? Yeah , it 's me .

490
00:48:58,368 --> 00:49:00,302
Come in .

491
00:49:00,370 --> 00:49:02,304
Come in .

492
00:49:14,117 --> 00:49:16,915
