493
00:49:16,987 --> 00:49:20,150
I don 't know . Maybe a crucifix would be better .

494
00:49:20,223 --> 00:49:23,750
A crucifix ? What the hell are you talking about ?

495
00:49:25,495 --> 00:49:27,429
[ Sighs ]

496
00:49:27,497 --> 00:49:29,829
Tell me the truth .

497
00:49:29,899 --> 00:49:33,733
Do you consider me a basket case ? No . Not at all . Why ?

498
00:49:33,803 --> 00:49:36,067
You 're nurturing a pet neurosis . That 's all .

499
00:49:36,139 --> 00:49:39,734
Like about 70 % of the female population of this country .

500
00:49:39,809 --> 00:49:44,712
So , according to you , I 'm not stark raving mad ? At least not yet .

501
00:49:44,781 --> 00:49:46,646
Don 't be silly . Of course not .

502
00:49:46,716 --> 00:49:48,741
Sometimes you may drink a little more than you should ,

503
00:49:48,818 --> 00:49:51,651
but that 's no reason to be taken away and put into a loony house .

504
00:49:51,721 --> 00:49:54,815
No . No , I 'd rather not right now , and you really shouldn 't either .

505
00:49:56,559 --> 00:50:01,587
All right . You better see for yourself . It 's in the kitchen .

506
00:50:01,664 --> 00:50:03,996
The kitchen ? Uh-huh .

507
00:50:04,067 --> 00:50:06,228
